# Optional. If unset, the app uses relative `/api` (Vite dev proxy -> http://localhost:5000;
# same-origin Express serving in production monolith deployments).
# For split-origin deployments (e.g. separate Static Site + Web Service), set the full backend API URL:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com/api

# VITE_API_URL=/api

# Optional custom KoboToolbox portal URL opened by the Forms admin shortcut
# VITE_KOBO_URL=https://kf.kobotoolbox.org
